Upstream notice
---------------
This repository packages custom controllers, configs, a Condor agent pack, and a
Cup dashboard that integrate with upstream projects. Their licenses still apply
to their own code:

- Hummingbot — https://github.com/hummingbot/hummingbot (Apache-2.0)
- Condor — https://github.com/hummingbot/condor (see upstream LICENSE)

Do not treat this pack as a full fork of either project. Install upstream
Hummingbot and Condor separately, then copy the files from this repo into place.
